{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8daaaa4807656a46bfc4ec7d37755aebd872fe6cc7c3bf0a91c4b08828915422", "ja": "（今日は莉緒と翼で『和風モダン』をテーマにした\nPV撮影だ。間もなく撮影が始まるのだが……）", "zh": "（今天是莉绪和翼以“和风现代”为主题拍摄PV。马上就要开始拍摄了，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "eea0afc212f85f5d1eed5bbe7e4e0e06a638f82ae3cc1b994c22f651f1773705", "ja": "ねえ、{$P$}さん。わたしも\n莉緒さんみたいに、オシャレに着崩したいな～。", "zh": "呐，{$P$}先生。我也想像莉绪姐那样，把衣服穿得时髦又随意些～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1002_p", "source_sha256": "70d0305d7beecd621bf885a3544201fc659aba53cc6e011297ff309422e83b17", "ja": "ダメだ！　あれは、莉緒だからなんとかギリギリ……。\nむしろ莉緒にも注意しに行くところで……。", "zh": "不行！那是因为莉绪才能勉强算是过关……不对，我正准备去提醒莉绪呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "bfb3222c351783169efeaa22581efe6e253487961372b6d0698e115e71318b08", "ja": "あら、ふたりともどうしたの？\nもうすぐ撮影が始まるみたい。早く準備を……。", "zh": "哎呀，你们两个怎么啦？\n拍摄好像马上就要开始了哦。快点准备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "571a1bb91434d289e58a64e4b1f0f8cfea8978c088df33b771a42bd6b1e18216", "ja": "聞いてくださいよ～！　わたしも莉緒さんみたいに\nセクシーに着たいのに……ダメって言うんです～！", "zh": "请听我说嘛～！我也想像莉绪姐那样穿得性感一点……可是他们说不行～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1005_p", "source_sha256": "358236db3f5ed701b82c7a704f60f98ddb8ee1823fcb8880d313a72b6522c9a8", "ja": "翼には翼の魅力があるんだから、\n無理に莉緒の真似をしなくてもいいと思うんだ。", "zh": "翼也有翼自己的魅力，所以我觉得没必要勉强模仿莉绪。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "275c2d349d062c28a4683b378ea67c8afe31defba245105829d5be53c701a61f", "ja": "え～！　でも莉緒さん、とってもキレイだし……\nわたしもあんな大人の色気で、モテモテになりたい～！", "zh": "哎～！可是莉绪姐真的好漂亮……  \n我也想拥有那种成熟女人的魅力，变得超受欢迎～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "51b08ef8ce4045ebb059b9b08fbe68b01086b9ed2145ac51d445412adb7f49e8", "ja": "ふふっ、嬉しいこと言ってくれるじゃな～い♪\n私と一緒に……セクシー路線、目指しちゃう？", "zh": "呵呵，说得真让人开心呀～♪\n要不要和我一起……走性感路线？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f7000f4ac1bf886a42334daf89af997f337a6c183af6df11a40307397c0572aa", "ja": "はーい、目指しちゃいま～す！\nふたりで、オトナなグラビア撮影しましょう♪", "zh": "好～的，当然要一起努力啦！\n我们两个人一起拍成熟风格的写真吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7", "ja": "えっ！？", "zh": "咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f3c4e6d537e293cc2315493530d463cc79947e2154e2e9ab3709e1226f9c4ebf", "ja": "（翼が完全にその気になってしまった。\nうーん、どうやって引き止めようか……）", "zh": "（翼已经完全来劲了。嗯——该怎么劝住她呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1011_046rio", "source_sha256": "d8dff0c68c4df9b225d2de6d55de7a0ef6b12de461b85ae91e7ea3a2c41fb495", "ja": "{$P$}くん、ここは私に任せて♪", "zh": "{$P$}，这里就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1012_p", "source_sha256": "66ef6c735e888f8fb51d7366911853dde4c798d7bcff2ebded9090a39b10f8f7", "ja": "莉緒……？", "zh": "莉绪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "7272edb9d5df9126e3d1e8d031d30ee02aea3f1700de06981664e66c34fd53fc", "ja": "ねえ、翼ちゃん？　肌を見せる以外にも、オトナを\n演出する方法があるんだけど……何かわかる？", "zh": "喂，小翼？除了露出肌肤以外，还有其他能展现成熟魅力的方法哦……你知道是什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6348bdc5af7a13d4299179cf257251cb44d0bbce486a4043021760e06b61649d", "ja": "ええ～？　なんだろ……。\n{$P$}さんは、わかります～？", "zh": "诶～？是什么呢……。\n{$P$}先生知道吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1015_p", "source_sha256": "22db83bd878c1643519efecf2feacd14de2861f83aeb059c47e88877e233d2c3", "ja": "これかなってのは、ひとつ思いついたけど……。", "zh": "我倒是想到一个可能是这个的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "34c193bcbf7c3804a1726d704a5366eccbf9cede36537047475d995acdf15dc6", "ja": "うふふ、正解は……メイクよ！　私がとっておきの\nオトナのメイク術を伝授してあげる♪", "zh": "呵呵，答案是……化妆哦！就由我来传授你\n压箱底的大人化妆术吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1017_046rio", "source_sha256": "f9fc757ea78fc6fc1a6bbb12feaae2a699401795fbe670c4c1a73252bb7f4e60", "ja": "今日はペアでのお仕事だし、私と翼ちゃんに\n統一感が出たら、とってもステキだと思わない？", "zh": "今天的工作是双人搭档，要是我和小翼之间\n能有统一感的话，不觉得非常棒吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "d6b917b1051c9bb11ced04e827050a1a38c4c9198d67c8af845b410c8ed698fc", "ja": "わぁ～、すごくステキかも～！　それに莉緒さんと\nお揃いのメイクなら、わたしもモテモテ確定ですね♪", "zh": "哇～，说不定会特别棒呢～！而且要是和莉绪姐化同款妆容，那我也肯定会超受欢迎啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5121171cdbe53967718f6fecd23f2b7f6991e9b14adca6a9426d935bbfdbe2a8", "ja": "うん、すごくいいじゃないか！\n翼、よかったな。", "zh": "嗯，非常不错嘛！\n翼，太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9506a6f1fade28c14e6c41f8eb0dc467c2b1960a824b747ed9661b90472f0749", "ja": "……莉緒、ありがとう。助かったよ。", "zh": "……莉绪，谢谢你。帮大忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1021_046rio", "source_sha256": "24dcce5a1484844222b41bfbc006eb24850961a1093b731ee73fbde445bca095", "ja": "いいのよ。だって私も翼ちゃんの気持ち、よくわかる\nもの。私が嬉しいと思うことを提案してあげただけよ。", "zh": "没关系啦。因为我也很懂小翼的心情\n嘛。我只是提了能让自己也开心的建议而已哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1022_046rio", "source_sha256": "78a3c8c8f055a9a08e7bae5dd74b0beb72ded53e2563cece78809d27b78a1a56", "ja": "と・こ・ろ・で……！　私はもっと肌を見せてもイイと\n思ってるんだけど？　谷間を強調してみたり……。", "zh": "话・说・回・来……！我觉得就算再多露一点肌肤也没关系吧？比如强调一下胸口的曲线……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1023_016tsu", "source_sha256": "efcb1eebbe19ab98a2137179bc329ea4d527b991eb16a0016c5043254163cd9e", "ja": "ええ～っ！　莉緒さん、もっとって……。\nモテモテな大人のお姉さんって、すごーい……！", "zh": "诶诶～！莉绪姐，还要更进一步吗……。受欢迎的成熟大姐姐，真厉害……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0424_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0424_1024_p", "source_sha256": "a6e520b77fc9e16be323d897a36780b7e4fcb26d218451f5a9f81c41fd96f9b9", "ja": "（その後、莉緒を説得するのに翼の倍以上の時間が\nかかった……。この二人、やっぱり似た者同士だな！）", "zh": "（之后，说服莉绪花了比说服翼多一倍以上的时间……这两个人果然很像啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
